<title>UK: Credit Local sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-yr bond. [CORRECTED 14:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-yr bond. [CORRECTED 14:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and WoodCommerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.625    MATURITY    12.MAR.98</p>
<p>(Corrects coupon from 10.675.)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.935   PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 25-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  85 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
